{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-31","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If an odd number be prime to any number, it will also be prime to the double of it.","book":9,"number":31,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":31,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","contentId":"euclid-9-31","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08441bcd7b4a453812da0a2e7121650bd75302010ca05428fa7baed42a8713a5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-31.statement","euclid-9-31.construction.1","euclid-9-31.proof.1","euclid-9-31.construction.2","euclid-9-31.proof.2","euclid-9-31.proof.3","euclid-9-31.proof.4","euclid-9-31.proof.5","euclid-9-31.proof.6","euclid-9-31.conclusion","euclid-9-31.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-31.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76647fd0528222750c5b6ee5b11e62535ee7bbea17952f2bc1bcd2d538289aff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an odd number be prime to any number, it will also be prime to the double of it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个奇数是任何数字的本数,它也将是其双倍数的本数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"979b14716dd894c1a6a3458de0bbb598334999d1289bebbdd23bfc3bf1751252","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the odd number A be prime to any number B, and let C be double of B; I say that A is prime to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"奇数A 等于B ,C 等于B 的两倍;我说A 等于 C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ff386251778b833e28cead041e338cf85fa5935e41a708a7b53f418d1ffdcf4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if they are not prime to one another, some number will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是互素, 某些数字将整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fee6ddcda880207e422d970c4b108b6c158c2775a98efe4eb5909c96736a70c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a number measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后D"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ded8e6a85405224c314aa7e69eda559f7a42b381147ac4c8fcff0a5500e221a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A is odd; therefore D is also odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在A是奇怪的,所以D也是奇怪的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d62bbcb52707ce9c4fb6e3754b91ccc82366a56f88ba1a9c57fe9d8abb851e8","citations":["euclid-9-30"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since D which is odd measures C, and C is even, therefore [D] will measure the half of C also. [[IX. 30](/principles/euclid-9-30)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D是奇数整除 C,C是平的, 因此,[D] 将整除 占C的一半。 [[IX. 30](/principles/euclid-9-30)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed166e2f183b6066d17f6033e3abf97240ab62e5eec10b17a1866ed9e56ea03b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But B is half of C; therefore D measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但B是C的一半,因此是D 整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bdf2f890a6393b0e228fce742962026cbab810d02336d1775a513f8035083ae3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures A; therefore D measures A, B which are prime to one another: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也整除 A; 因此,D 整除 A,B, 即互素: 这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7d8519b802eac6fc0e4662c3ec68d1fc7084d8a62ac309e6e616d6ab4fad99b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A cannot but be prime to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A只能达到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"698cb8b6f15e9f5ec678daa562791fefc40b0d4575db81fbd32a06e779691987","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, C are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,C是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-31.source","contentId":"euclid-9-31","revisionId":"euclid-9-31@raw-08441bcd7b4a4538","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b28bd99771d0f17f1eff2be7d20ee14f2179f2621ad28a4740f62256d78ff4a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-31:euclid-9-30:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-31.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-30","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.31/","sourceLabel":"IX. 30"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-31:euclid-9-30:explicit","id":"euclid-9-30","book":9,"number":30,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
